[0.052, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;246m\r\n✻\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mChurned for 3s\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[48;5;237m\r\n❯ \u001b[38;5;231mI wanted him to notice I was cold\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[49m\u001b[48;5;237m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;231mBEFORE I HAD TO ASK!!!\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[49m\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;231m\r\n⏺\u001b[39m That's the telepathy problem walking right through the door — but this time with a draft coming   \u001b[9;1H  through it too.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  So you were cold, he didn't clock it, and the tally started. Did you catch yourself doing it in   \u001b[12;1H  the moment, or only after — once you were forty minutes into arguing about the window itself?     \u001b[13;1H\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;246m\r\n✻\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mBaked for 6s\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[48;5;237m\r\n❯ \u001b[38;5;231mok, ok. you got me.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[49m\u001b[48;5;237m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;231mkeep that — mine, word for word, caps and all 📌\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[49m\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;114m\r\n⏺\u001b[39m \u001b[1mSkill\u001b(B\u001b[m(claudia:keep)\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;246m\r\n  ⎿  \u001b[39mSuccessfully loaded skill\u001b[38;5;246m · \u001b[39m5 tools allowed\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  Reading \u001b[1m1\u001b(B\u001b[m file, listing \u001b[1m1\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
